      children: "These implementations demonstrate how edge functions can make sophisticated decisions about asset delivery while maintaining the low latency characteristics that make edge deployment valuable. The key is balancing computational cost against the value provided by intelligent delivery decisions."
    }), "\n", "\n", _jsx(_components.h2, {
